  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/cobweb/banner.png\" alt=\"蜘蛛網橫幅\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/minecraft.svg\" alt=\"Minecraft\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobweb/files?version=26.1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/26-1-x.svg\" alt=\"26.1.x\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"Separator\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobweb/files?version=1.21.11\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-11.svg\" alt=\"1.21.11\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"Separator\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobweb/files?version=1.21.10\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-10.svg\" alt=\"1.21.10\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"Separator\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobweb/files?version=1.21.8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-8.svg\" alt=\"1.21.8\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"Separator\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobweb/files?version=1.21.7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-7.svg\" alt=\"1.21.7\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"Separator\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobweb/files?version=1.21.6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-6.svg\" alt=\"1.21.6\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"Separator\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobweb/files?version=1.21.5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-5.svg\" alt=\"1.21.5\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"Separator\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobweb/files?version=1.21.4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-4.svg\" alt=\"1.21.4\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"Separator\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobweb/files?version=1.21.3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-3.svg\" alt=\"1.21.3\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"Separator\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobweb/files?version=1.21.1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-1.svg\" alt=\"1.21.1\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"Separator\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobweb/files?version=1.21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21.svg\" alt=\"1.21\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/loader/loader.svg\" alt=\"載入器\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobweb/files?gameVersionTypeId=6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/loader/neoforge.svg\" alt=\"NeoForge\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"Separator\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobweb/files?gameVersionTypeId=4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/loader/fabric.svg\" alt=\"Fabric\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/side/client-server.svg\" alt=\"共用與獨立\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/github/issues.svg\" alt=\"問題回報\"><a href=\"https://github.com/crystal-nest/cobweb/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/github/github.svg\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>📝 <strong>描述</strong></h2>\n<p><strong>Cobweb</strong> 是一個輕量級、模組化的 API，旨在簡化跨多個載入器的 Minecraft 模組開發。<br>\n它提供<strong>統一設定系統</strong>與<strong>統一註冊系統</strong>，兩者均可直接在共用模組中使用。這些系統可幫助您抽象化不同載入器之間的差異，讓您專注於編寫乾淨、易維護且可重複使用的程式碼——而非样板程式碼。</p>\n<p>Cobweb 是 <strong>Crystal Nest</strong> 所有專案共用的模組開發 API。<br>\n📚 想深入了解嗎？請查看完整的 <a href=\"https://github.com/Crystal-Nest/cobweb/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wiki</a>。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraftstorage.com%252fmods%252fcobweb%253fref%253dcrystal-nest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/cobweb/minecraft-storage-banner.png\" alt=\"Minecraft 儲存空間\"></a></p>\n<h2>✨ <strong>功能特色</strong></h2>\n<p>無論您是在為 Fabric 還是 NeoForge 進行開發，Cobweb 都能協助統一您的模組開發工作流程。您可以將其作為多載入器專案的基礎，或作為依賴項來簡化您的架構！</p>\n<h3>🔄 通用功能（所有載入器）：</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>✅ 統一設定系統 — 一次撰寫設定檔，隨處載入</li>\n<li>✅ 統一註冊系統 — 抽象化載入器專屬的註冊邏輯</li>\n<li>🔍 簡易 API 用於擷取遊戲內的 ID</li>\n<li>📦 建立並註冊<strong>動態</strong>資源包 <em>（實驗性功能）</em></li>\n<li>📦 建立並註冊<strong>內建</strong>（靜態）資源包</li>\n<li>🌀 動態方塊實體，用於處理可變動的方塊集合</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Fabric 專屬功能：</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>📝 簡化註冊系統。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>NeoForge 專屬功能：</h3>\n<p>目前尚無。</p>\n<h2>📜 <strong>授權與使用權利</strong></h2>\n<p>歡迎將此模組用於任何模組、整合包或影片中，只需註明出處並附上 <a href=\"https://github.com/crystal-nest/cobweb#readme\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a> 的連結。<br>\n本專案採用 <a href=\"https://github.com/crystal-nest/cobweb/blob/master/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Crystal Nest Community License v1</a> 授權發布。</p>\n<h2>❤️ <strong>支援我們</strong></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrystalnest.it%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Crystal Nest 官網\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/crystal-nest/pic512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/BP6EdBfAmt\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Discord\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/discord/discord512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/crystalspider\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Patreon\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/patreon/patreon512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fcrystalspider\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Ko-fi\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/kofi/kofi512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><img alt=\"其他專案\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/github/github512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252forganization%252fcrystal-nest\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Modrinth\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/modrinth/modrinth512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/crystalspider/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"CurseForge\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/curseforge/curseforge512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fcrystalspider\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/d559b544-474c-4109-b861-1b2e6ca6026a.webp\" alt=\"Bisect Hosting\"></a></p></p>",
